      "side": 1,
      "message": "VariantToUnsignedIntVisitor performs an unchecked static_cast\u003cunsigned int\u003e. Negative signed values or uint64_t values larger than UINT_MAX can wrap and result in an unintended retry delay. Could we validate the numeric range before converting, or preserve the source type until validation?",
      "revId": "d118be0b5b4461349c2e3f4b2db2994c9720d00f",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
